### Mechanic: Win Condition Logic
INTENT: detects when the puck reaches the bell height, awards tickets based on streak, destroys the puck, and triggers the tower gauge shift if the streak is high enough.
PSEUDO:
  if GetPosition(puck) >= bell_height then
    tickets = Engine.GetStreak() * TICKET_BASE
    Engine.AwardTickets(tickets, "High Striker Win")
    DestroyBody(puck)
    if Engine.GetStreak() > 1 then
      Engine.AwardTokens(1, "Streak Bonus")
    end
  end
