### Mechanic: Loss Condition Logic
INTENT: terminates the attraction and resets state when the mallet integrity drops to zero or the puck falls below the platform.
PSEUDO:
  if mallet_integrity <= 0.0 then
    DestroyBody(mallet)
    Engine.AwardTickets(0, "Loss")
    return
  end
  puck_pos = GetPosition(puck)
  if puck_pos.y < platform.y then
    DestroyBody(puck)
    DestroyBody(mallet)
    Engine.AwardTickets(0, "Loss")
    return
  end
